# Intention Header Footer Code conventions

## Purpose

HFCM-style sitewide HTML / CSS / JS snippets for Grav 2 Admin Next: list + edit UI, enable/disable, frontend and/or backend injection, header/footer location, optional JS defer/async.

## Layout

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `intention-header-footer-code.php` | Events: API routes, sidebar, plugin page, floating widget, front inject |
| `classes/SnippetRepository.php` | YAML CRUD under `user/data/intention-header-footer-code/snippets.yaml` (runtime data — do not commit site data from this repo) |
| `classes/SnippetInjector.php` | Front-end Asset Manager + HTML output injection |
| `classes/Api/IntentionHeaderFooterCodeController.php` | REST CRUD + `/active` |
| `admin-next/pages/intention-header-footer-code.js` | List + edit Admin Next page |
| `admin-next/widgets/intention-header-footer-code.js` | autoLoad backend injector (`showFab: false`) |
| `assets/admin/page.css` | Admin list/edit styles (lazy-linked by page JS) |
| `assets/admin/highlight.min.js` | highlight.js (CSS + JavaScript langs) for code fields |

## CSS

Keep admin styles in `assets/admin/page.css`. Prefer `hfc-*` class names with single hyphens (no BEM `__` / `--`). Do not add inline `<style>` in JS unless the user asks.

## Code editor

- **CSS / JS** types: overlay textarea + `highlight.min.js` (`language-css` / `language-javascript`).
- **HTML** type: plain textarea (bundle has no HTML/XML language).
- Load highlight via script tag from `assets/admin/highlight.min.js` — do not use CDN CodeMirror.

## Injection rules

- **Frontend:** `onOutputGenerated` injects CSS/JS/HTML with `<!-- Added by Intention Header Footer Code plugin -->` above each block. Skip admin and API routes.
- **Backend:** floating widget with `autoLoad: true`, `showFab: false`; inject at module load with the same HTML comment marker (Admin2 may not mount the element when FAB is hidden).
- CSS always goes in `<head>` even if location is footer (document in UI help text).
- No PHP snippet type. Snippets run as-is — keep the UI warning.

## Admin Next

- Sidebar route: `/plugin/intention-header-footer-code`
- Permissions: `admin.intention-header-footer-code.read` / `.write`
- Delete confirms via `window.__GRAV_DIALOGS` — never native `confirm()`
- API auth header: `X-API-Token`

See [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).
